{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Strangers Lurk is a next gen horror experience played from the POV of a bodycam as you try to survive a night of being stalked and taunted by a unknown masked stranger.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580210/extras/Lib_Logo.png?t=1742310142\" /><strong>Story</strong><i>:</i><br><i>Play as Erica who works as a nanny for insurance purposes she is required to wear a bodycam while sitting for people. Its a friday night and the neighbors down the road had their sitter cancel last minute and asked you if you could come instead. What starts as a normal nights sitting becomes a chilling fight for survival as a masked maniac taunts you. Will you survive the night? Or will you become another victim of this deranged masked stranger. </i> <br>  <br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong>  <br>  <br><strong>Multiple areas to explore: </strong> <br>Set across 2 levels with\u00a0multiple houses to explore with dark corners everywhere and danger could lurk at any moment.   <br>   <br><strong>Realistic Environment:\u00a0  </strong>  <br>This game is built with Unreal Engine 5 to create a terrifying realistic home alone experience.   <br>   <br><strong>Jump Scares </strong> <br><strong> </strong>One minute your exploring peacefully the next your running for your life, Jumpscares can come fast and unexpected which will make you question your every move.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580210?t=1742310142","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580210?t=1742310142","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580210/38e9c318892dda78dd3e566de752f790b301e2c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742310142","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580210/38e9c318892dda78dd3e566de752f790b301e2c3/capsule_184x69.jp